  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "In working towards a data migration from 2 and 3-series Fedora, developing a basic tool or framework to process for FOXML may help centralize the various efforts and provide a baseline for discussion.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This ticket is just to create a first draft of a tool that:",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "1.  Processes FOXML1.1",
       "type": "text"
      },
      {
       "type": "hardBreak"
      },
      {
       "text": "2.  Translates (or at least has hooks for translating) every bit o data into Fedora 4",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "This tool may eventually end up as a very configurable script, the core of a robust interactive migration tool or an experiment to help flush out major considerations.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "marks": [
        {
         "attrs": {
          "href": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Fedora+3+to+4+Data+Migration"
         },
         "type": "link"
        }
       ],
       "text": "https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Fedora+3+to+4+Data+Migration",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    }
