  "description": "<p>In working towards a data migration from 2 and 3-series Fedora, developing a basic tool or framework to process for FOXML may help centralize the various efforts and provide a baseline for discussion.</p>\n\n<p>This ticket is just to create a first draft of a tool that:<br/>\n1.  Processes FOXML1.1<br/>\n2.  Translates (or at least has hooks for translating) every bit o data into Fedora 4</p>\n\n<p>This tool may eventually end up as a very configurable script, the core of a robust interactive migration tool or an experiment to help flush out major considerations.</p>\n\n<p><a href=\"https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Fedora+3+to+4+Data+Migration\" class=\"external-link\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer\">https://wiki.duraspace.org/display/FF/Fedora+3+to+4+Data+Migration</a></p>",
